38          * Source: S154 / Chapter 103 / `ESTIMATE Statement` (PDF pp. 8384–8385); S154 / Chapter 103 / `TEST
38       ! Statement` (PDF pp. 8392–8393); S154 / Chapter 103 / `Confidence Interval` (PDF pp. 8402–8405).
39          * Discriminates: Explicit ESTIMATE, TEST statement behavior on seeded synthetic inputs.
